        "content": "# VictoriaLogs Dashboard\n\n* [LogsQL](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victorialogs/logsql/index.html)\n* [LogsQL Examples](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victorialogs/logsql-examples/)\n* [Querying on CLI](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victorialogs/querying/) \n* [logsQL.py CLI helper](https://github.com/teamapps-org/ansible-collection-teamapps-general/blob/main/roles/victorialogs/files/logsQL.py), [README](https://github.com/teamapps-org/ansible-collection-teamapps-general/blob/main/roles/victorialogs/files/README.md)",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.1.1",
